      "assessment": {
        "nobel_worthiness": "Optical lattice clocks have transformed precision measurement through a fundamental advance in controlling atoms and time.",
        "attribution": "Katori originated the magic-wavelength lattice-clock concept and Ye made decisive experimental advances toward its high-accuracy realization.",
        "maturity": "Independent laboratories have established exceptional performance and broad scientific use over many years.",
